WEBVTT

01:37.830 --> 01:43.060
[Shadow Punisher]

01:43.180 --> 01:43.670
[Divine Constable Tally]

01:43.670 --> 01:45.950
[Episode 3]

01:51.920 --> 01:53.520
How did he get here before us?

01:59.640 --> 02:00.480
Li Qingyang,

02:00.840 --> 02:02.040
do you know the punishment

02:02.040 --> 02:03.570
for breaking out of prison?

02:08.039 --> 02:09.280
Lady Constable Frost,

02:09.280 --> 02:10.470
this isn't the first time

02:10.470 --> 02:11.930
I've broken out of prison.

02:12.080 --> 02:13.120
Besides,

02:13.120 --> 02:14.590
the shackles
of your Divine Constable Bureau

02:14.590 --> 02:15.560
can't trap me.

02:15.910 --> 02:17.079
Instead of sitting and waiting there,

02:17.079 --> 02:18.280
being wronged by you,

02:18.280 --> 02:20.410
I'd rather take the initiative to move

02:20.470 --> 02:22.910
and catch the real culprit
to prove my innocence.

02:22.910 --> 02:23.960
This way,

02:24.190 --> 02:25.360
even if I

02:25.520 --> 02:27.430
have offended your bureau a lot,

02:27.710 --> 02:29.430
I can make up for it.

02:29.430 --> 02:30.280
Right?

02:30.870 --> 02:31.630
Chief,

02:31.630 --> 02:32.910
if we run into Li Qingyang,

02:32.910 --> 02:34.079
what should we do?

02:34.430 --> 02:36.360
This person is highly suspicious.

02:36.710 --> 02:37.710
If he's caught,

02:38.120 --> 02:39.280
bring him back to the bureau.

02:39.280 --> 02:40.800
I'll interrogate him in person.

02:40.800 --> 02:43.520
If he still won't behave,

02:44.310 --> 02:45.630
don't push too hard.

02:46.190 --> 02:48.280
Observe his words and actions.

02:48.520 --> 02:51.079
Only then can you know what he's up to.

02:51.870 --> 02:52.680
Alright,

02:52.870 --> 02:53.680
let me see

02:53.680 --> 02:55.360
how you prove your innocence.

02:56.079 --> 02:56.870
Please.

02:58.680 --> 03:00.710
Thank you, Lady Constable Frost.

03:10.430 --> 03:12.310
According to what the Advisor said,

03:12.310 --> 03:14.170
he saw the coroner, Wen Nansheng,

03:14.190 --> 03:15.970
carrying this bundle out.

03:16.120 --> 03:17.240
Undoubtedly,

03:17.400 --> 03:18.520
inside this bag are

03:18.520 --> 03:20.150
Master Sun's body parts.

03:20.630 --> 03:21.710
And Wen Nansheng

03:22.120 --> 03:24.680
abandoned the body here and fled.

03:25.120 --> 03:26.920
Tell us something we don't know.

03:50.200 --> 03:52.140
Wen Nansheng's jade pendant?

03:53.079 --> 03:55.079
This head is indeed Master Sun's,

03:55.120 --> 03:56.560
but only the upper half
of the body is his.

03:56.560 --> 03:57.760
The lower half isn't.

03:59.960 --> 04:01.820
Are you so sure, Constable Frost?

04:02.430 --> 04:04.120
I can tell everything about a body

04:04.120 --> 04:05.750
that I've handled at a glance.

04:05.750 --> 04:07.080
Judging from the corpse's swollen legs,

04:07.080 --> 04:07.910
they were mostly caused

04:07.910 --> 04:09.870
by the coroner's long exposure
to damp places.

04:09.870 --> 04:11.840
The jade pendant left on these clothes

04:11.840 --> 04:13.280
belongs to Wen Nansheng.

04:13.710 --> 04:15.310
But judging from the cut,

04:15.560 --> 04:17.190
the murder weapon is still

04:17.190 --> 04:19.720
the silk thread used
to control puppet dolls.

04:23.240 --> 04:24.270
I got it.

04:24.630 --> 04:26.680
The murderer first killed Master Sun

04:26.680 --> 04:29.310
and then killed Wen Nansheng.

04:29.630 --> 04:30.630
He mixed the lower half

04:30.630 --> 04:31.890
of Wen Nansheng's body

04:31.950 --> 04:33.750
with the upper half

04:33.750 --> 04:34.950
of Master Sun's body.

04:35.360 --> 04:36.920
Then he took away

04:36.920 --> 04:38.520
the lower half of Master Sun.

04:39.560 --> 04:40.510
He did this

04:40.750 --> 04:42.310
to make people mistakenly believe

04:42.310 --> 04:43.720
that from beginning to end,

04:43.720 --> 04:45.190
there was only one corpse—

04:45.190 --> 04:46.480
Master Sun's body.

04:48.870 --> 04:49.680
Continue.

04:52.560 --> 04:53.390
Ms. Bai,

04:54.070 --> 04:57.120
does Dead Bone Spice
have the effect of warding off evil?

04:57.120 --> 04:59.720
It is indeed recorded
in the Strange Medicines Chapter.

04:59.720 --> 05:00.870
Why do you ask?

05:03.120 --> 05:04.780
Last night, Mr. Meng and I were

05:05.040 --> 05:06.240
repeatedly caught in illusions.

05:06.240 --> 05:07.390
But today,

05:07.560 --> 05:09.160
we are both completely fine.

05:09.470 --> 05:10.660
You mean

05:10.950 --> 05:12.680
the scent of Dead Bone Spice
on the silk thread

05:12.680 --> 05:14.410
broke the illusion formation?

05:15.270 --> 05:16.120
No wonder.

05:16.510 --> 05:17.240
A lot of young women were

05:17.240 --> 05:18.630
murdered in Tianhuang City.

05:18.630 --> 05:19.310
This shows the murderer

05:19.310 --> 05:20.750
needs a large amount of Dead Bone Spice

05:20.750 --> 05:21.750
to safely enter

05:21.750 --> 05:23.880
the Black Wind Forest in Dougu County.

05:24.070 --> 05:25.310
It seems that Dead Bone Spice is

05:25.310 --> 05:26.770
going to be a key clue next.

05:27.120 --> 05:27.950
Don't forget

05:29.070 --> 05:30.240
about the puppet doll

05:30.240 --> 05:31.750
that abducted the children.

05:31.750 --> 05:32.680
Puppet doll?

05:33.070 --> 05:35.120
It's all based on eyewitness statements.

05:35.120 --> 05:36.159
Did you see it?

05:38.360 --> 05:39.510
Not exactly.

05:40.270 --> 05:41.120
Li Qingyang,

05:41.720 --> 05:42.480
I still remember

05:42.480 --> 05:43.190
the puppet doll found

05:43.190 --> 05:44.560
in your Star-Gathering Pavilion.

05:44.560 --> 05:46.190
What on earth are you up to?

05:52.159 --> 05:53.120
My Lord, My Lady,

05:53.750 --> 05:55.150
there's no time to waste.

05:55.310 --> 05:56.950
Most of the spice shops here

05:57.360 --> 05:58.890
don't sell Dead Bone Spice,

05:58.950 --> 05:59.720
but

06:00.830 --> 06:02.560
we should still go try our luck.

06:02.630 --> 06:03.560
Perhaps

06:04.160 --> 06:05.720
there will be new clues.

06:28.240 --> 06:29.160
Ms. Bai,

06:31.630 --> 06:32.960
what do you mean by this?

06:35.830 --> 06:37.240
Sealed acupoints with golden needles.

06:37.240 --> 06:38.430
Your lightness skill is marvelous.

06:38.430 --> 06:39.560
I have to be on guard.

06:40.310 --> 06:41.190
Sorry for that.

06:43.930 --> 06:46.070
[Dougu]

06:46.150 --> 06:48.310
[Tumi House]

06:53.540 --> 06:57.250
[Tumi House]

06:53.830 --> 06:54.760
My Lord, My Lady,

06:54.870 --> 06:56.040
this is the most famous spice shop

06:56.040 --> 06:57.360
in our county.

06:57.720 --> 06:58.800
Tumi House?

07:04.750 --> 07:05.560
Bro,

07:06.680 --> 07:07.800
why are you carrying

07:07.800 --> 07:09.160
a puppet doll on your back?

07:09.160 --> 07:09.950
This?

07:10.070 --> 07:11.160
I borrowed it from a troupe.

07:11.160 --> 07:12.560
It's just a normal puppet

07:12.560 --> 07:14.240
for those eyewitnesses to identify.

07:14.240 --> 07:16.700
But they all said
they didn't see it clearly.

07:19.680 --> 07:21.100
[Tumi House]

07:20.390 --> 07:21.190
Li Qingyang.

07:22.040 --> 07:23.370
Who allowed you to go in?

07:25.270 --> 07:26.120
Ms. Bai,

07:26.430 --> 07:28.040
my acupoints are sealed
with golden needles.

07:28.040 --> 07:30.040
What tricks can I possibly play now?

07:32.920 --> 07:33.720
My Lord, My Lady,

07:33.720 --> 07:35.270
please be extra careful going in.

07:35.270 --> 07:36.200
What do you mean?

07:36.630 --> 07:38.720
Something happened
to this shop not long ago.

07:38.720 --> 07:39.560
The owner of this shop

07:39.560 --> 07:41.270
has gone mad.

07:44.070 --> 07:44.950
I

07:45.720 --> 07:48.430
missed you so much.

07:52.159 --> 07:53.800
You look unfamiliar, sir.

07:54.560 --> 07:56.340
What brings you

07:57.159 --> 07:58.870
to my Tumi House?

07:58.870 --> 07:59.680
I'm here

08:00.270 --> 08:01.800
to ask about a kind of spice.

08:02.560 --> 08:03.360
Could it be

08:04.360 --> 08:05.720
Dead Bone Spice?

08:14.070 --> 08:14.870
Sir,

08:15.630 --> 08:18.430
I am still

08:18.430 --> 08:20.680
an unmarried maiden.

08:25.870 --> 08:27.920
Staring at me like this is

08:29.920 --> 08:31.600
quite impertinent.

08:39.539 --> 08:41.140
It really is Dead Bone Spice.

08:41.150 --> 08:42.270
How could this be?

08:42.840 --> 08:44.100
Why are you surprised?

08:45.150 --> 08:46.360
Refining Dead Bone Spice

08:46.360 --> 08:47.440
requires the blood of young girls

08:47.440 --> 08:48.720
with pure Yin birth characters.

08:48.720 --> 08:50.080
In the past, if a poor girl

08:50.080 --> 08:51.910
who met the conditions
fell terminally ill,

08:51.910 --> 08:53.840
she would be sold to spice refiners,

08:53.840 --> 08:55.900
who used her body to refine the Spice.

08:55.960 --> 08:57.360
This was a way to earn money
for her family

08:57.360 --> 08:58.270
in her final days.

08:58.270 --> 08:59.030
Exactly.

08:59.720 --> 09:01.270
The rare Dead Bone Spice

09:01.440 --> 09:03.150
in Tianhuang City's black market

09:03.150 --> 09:04.600
mostly comes from this.

09:05.630 --> 09:06.890
Such an opportunity is

09:06.910 --> 09:09.600
hard to come by even in decades.

09:10.320 --> 09:13.150
So even across the entire Great Shi,

09:13.150 --> 09:15.680
the supply
of Dead Bone Spice is very limited.

09:16.120 --> 09:17.080
I didn't expect

09:17.630 --> 09:20.630
that such a remote, rural backwater
like Dougu County

09:20.840 --> 09:22.900
would have this rare Dead Bone Spice.

09:23.510 --> 09:24.870
Tumi House was burglarized

09:24.870 --> 09:26.150
2 months ago.

09:26.440 --> 09:27.870
Actually, not too many spices were

09:27.870 --> 09:28.960
missing from the House.

09:28.960 --> 09:29.750
But

09:30.080 --> 09:30.960
somehow,

09:30.960 --> 09:32.080
the owner of this shop

09:32.080 --> 09:32.720
seemed to have

09:32.720 --> 09:33.910
suffered a great hit

09:34.320 --> 09:35.150
and gone mad.

09:36.870 --> 09:37.870
Two months ago?

09:38.520 --> 09:40.630
The case of refining the Spice
with young girls in Tianhuang City

09:40.630 --> 09:42.360
and the disappearance of children
in Dougu County

09:42.360 --> 09:43.030
were both...

09:43.030 --> 09:45.080
They both started 2 months ago.

09:47.270 --> 09:49.530
Could the stolen item be
Dead Bone Spice?

09:49.870 --> 09:51.320
I have never seen that legendary

09:51.320 --> 09:52.550
and precious item,

09:52.670 --> 09:54.720
so I'm not too sure either.

09:54.960 --> 09:56.420
Who robbed the spice shop?

09:56.630 --> 09:57.870
Has the case been solved?

09:57.870 --> 09:58.670
Well...

09:59.440 --> 10:01.220
You can neither find the missing children

10:01.220 --> 10:02.720
nor catch a petty thief!

10:02.720 --> 10:04.030
Your Dougu County government is really...

10:04.030 --> 10:04.750
My Lady,

10:05.030 --> 10:06.550
you can't blame it on us.

10:06.670 --> 10:08.030
This theft case is really

10:08.030 --> 10:08.960
quite bizarre.

10:09.670 --> 10:10.960
As you can see,

10:11.480 --> 10:13.030
to keep the fragrance,

10:13.030 --> 10:14.720
Tumi House has sealed
all the windows here.

10:14.720 --> 10:16.670
The only opening is this door.

10:17.080 --> 10:18.630
The spices here are so precious

10:18.630 --> 10:19.870
that the owner would lock the door

10:19.870 --> 10:20.960
when he closes the shop every day.

10:20.960 --> 10:21.630
After the incident,

10:21.630 --> 10:23.080
we also checked the lock,

10:23.080 --> 10:24.480
and it was intact.

10:24.840 --> 10:26.240
In a situation like this,

10:26.480 --> 10:27.360
unless...

10:31.170 --> 10:32.910
Unless it was a ghost manifesting,

10:32.910 --> 10:33.750
how else could

10:33.750 --> 10:35.000
this be explained?

10:36.630 --> 10:38.360
No other entrance or exit
besides the door?

10:38.360 --> 10:39.360
Then what is this?

10:41.870 --> 10:42.720
Ms. Bai,

10:44.150 --> 10:45.120
this dog hole is too small

10:45.120 --> 10:46.310
even for a 7-year-old child

10:46.310 --> 10:47.120
to get in,

10:47.120 --> 10:48.550
let alone a thief.

10:50.360 --> 10:51.510
You may go out first.

10:51.670 --> 10:53.200
Bring Young Master Qingyang out, too.

10:53.200 --> 10:53.930
Understood.

10:54.630 --> 10:55.440
Don't bother.

10:58.120 --> 10:59.380
I will leave by myself.

11:05.030 --> 11:06.080
He is right.

11:06.720 --> 11:07.600
Even one who masters

11:07.600 --> 11:09.030
the Bone-Shrinking Technique or something

11:09.030 --> 11:10.270
can't get out.

11:10.480 --> 11:11.270
Unless

11:11.630 --> 11:13.360
the thief is the size of a child.

11:47.150 --> 11:48.390
The puppet doll...

12:03.750 --> 12:04.600
What is this?

12:05.630 --> 12:06.670
Puppetry.

12:07.080 --> 12:08.010
I've learned it.

12:09.870 --> 12:11.080
Lady Constable Frost,

12:11.080 --> 12:12.510
didn't you find one

12:12.530 --> 12:14.150
in my Star-Gathering Pavilion?

12:14.150 --> 12:14.960
What?

12:15.270 --> 12:16.400
Have you forgotten?

12:17.960 --> 12:19.550
I didn't expect you
to still be able to perform

12:19.550 --> 12:21.510
puppetry with your acupoints sealed
by golden needles.

12:21.510 --> 12:23.170
I really underestimated you.

12:26.510 --> 12:29.870
Sealing acupoints with golden needles
restricts inner power.

12:29.870 --> 12:32.470
What does it have to do
with controlling a puppet?

12:32.470 --> 12:33.320
Are

12:33.960 --> 12:36.240
inner power masters
the only ones in the world

12:36.240 --> 12:37.720
who can perform puppetry?

12:40.480 --> 12:41.360
At least it proves

12:41.360 --> 12:42.750
that a puppet doll
can crawl through this dog hole

12:42.750 --> 12:44.080
to steal the Dead Bone Spice.

12:44.080 --> 12:45.360
So the spice thief is

12:45.720 --> 12:46.360
someone who can

12:46.360 --> 12:47.870
control puppet dolls.

12:48.720 --> 12:50.080
I don't think so.

12:51.030 --> 12:51.840
Firstly,

12:52.150 --> 12:54.010
many people can control puppets.

12:54.550 --> 12:55.360
Secondly,

12:56.030 --> 12:57.360
actually, a puppet doll

12:57.670 --> 12:59.470
can't steal the Dead Bone Spice.

13:00.030 --> 13:01.750
I did this experiment

13:02.360 --> 13:04.080
just to prove this point.

13:07.510 --> 13:08.360
Indeed,

13:09.150 --> 13:10.550
it can crawl in.

13:10.750 --> 13:11.550
However,

13:12.360 --> 13:14.160
what happens after it crawls in?

13:15.960 --> 13:17.150
A puppet is not a dog.

13:17.870 --> 13:19.470
How could it steal the Spice?

13:22.440 --> 13:24.440
You are just a beginner in puppetry.

13:25.240 --> 13:26.720
Just because you can't do it

13:26.720 --> 13:28.780
doesn't mean your accomplice can't.

13:33.330 --> 13:34.590
Lady Constable Frost,

13:35.510 --> 13:37.030
puppetry is basically

13:37.150 --> 13:38.610
an extension of the hands.

13:38.740 --> 13:39.820
A puppet is not a human.

13:39.820 --> 13:41.630
It cannot see or think.

13:41.970 --> 13:44.560
If the murderer outside the dog hole

13:44.960 --> 13:46.750
couldn't see the situation inside,

13:46.750 --> 13:48.220
it'd be absolutely impossible for him

13:48.220 --> 13:49.030
to control the puppet

13:49.030 --> 13:51.290
to steal the Dead Bone Spice from inside.

13:51.320 --> 13:52.120
Unless

13:52.720 --> 13:54.150
someone can train a puppet

13:54.150 --> 13:55.360
to have a mind.

13:55.750 --> 13:56.590
Otherwise,

13:56.960 --> 13:58.620
as long as it's just puppetry,

13:58.670 --> 14:01.200
it's definitely impossible
to achieve this.

14:03.360 --> 14:04.150
Seems like

14:04.480 --> 14:06.080
the clue has gone cold again.

14:09.870 --> 14:10.800
My Lord, My Lady,

14:11.150 --> 14:12.320
do you want to hear

14:12.720 --> 14:14.150
the clues I've found?

14:25.670 --> 14:27.000
The spices brought in by this Tumi House

14:27.000 --> 14:29.200
in Dougu County are famous far and wide.

14:29.750 --> 14:30.550
It's said

14:31.360 --> 14:33.120
that the original owner here was

14:33.120 --> 14:34.720
a graceful young woman.

14:34.960 --> 14:37.870
Everyone called her Lady Fragrance.

14:40.750 --> 14:41.550
But now, look

14:41.550 --> 14:43.350
at this shop owner in front of us.

14:44.150 --> 14:45.910
If you call him a lady,

14:46.240 --> 14:47.600
everyone in Dougu County

14:47.600 --> 14:48.550
must be blind.

14:52.120 --> 14:53.920
Then who exactly is this person?

14:55.240 --> 14:56.200
Two months ago,

14:56.750 --> 14:58.910
the Dead Bone Spice
in Tianhuang City's black market was

14:58.910 --> 15:00.320
so valuable and hard to come by.

15:00.320 --> 15:03.080
You two also know about this.

15:03.840 --> 15:04.750
Soon after,

15:05.080 --> 15:07.670
Lady Fragrance
disappeared without a trace.

15:07.960 --> 15:08.910
At this time,

15:09.240 --> 15:10.550
here in Tumi House,

15:10.960 --> 15:13.600
a heavily made-up Mr. Fragrance

15:13.630 --> 15:15.910
appeared out of nowhere.

15:19.120 --> 15:19.960
I heard

15:21.320 --> 15:22.550
that Lady Fragrance

15:23.360 --> 15:24.720
has an elder brother.

15:26.720 --> 15:27.960
You mean

15:28.720 --> 15:29.960
the brother killed his younger sister

15:29.960 --> 15:32.490
to refine Dead Bone Spice
and rake in profits?

15:39.080 --> 15:40.520
This blood-stained,

15:41.120 --> 15:42.960
invaluable Dead Bone Spice

15:43.240 --> 15:44.550
was stolen overnight.

15:46.030 --> 15:47.840
Since then, he has turned

15:47.840 --> 15:49.200
into the way he is now.

15:49.670 --> 15:51.150
The county government
couldn't find evidence

15:51.150 --> 15:52.630
to prove he committed murder,

15:52.630 --> 15:53.790
and neither did they find

15:53.790 --> 15:55.120
Lady Fragrance's body.

15:55.630 --> 15:57.320
Given his current state,

15:57.550 --> 15:58.750
County Magistrate Du

15:59.030 --> 16:00.960
just left him alone.

16:04.550 --> 16:06.870
Brother,

16:07.150 --> 16:11.720
you're here.

16:12.510 --> 16:13.750
I

16:15.150 --> 16:21.480
missed you so much.

16:21.960 --> 16:23.000
If the spice thief is

16:23.000 --> 16:24.800
the murderer we're looking for,

16:24.960 --> 16:26.720
then everything lines up.

16:26.910 --> 16:27.720
Exactly.

16:28.080 --> 16:29.870
A puppet doll was used
in the case of refining the Spice

16:29.870 --> 16:31.360
with young girls in Tianhuang City.

16:31.360 --> 16:32.720
The missing children here were

16:32.720 --> 16:34.450
also abducted by puppet dolls.

16:34.720 --> 16:36.510
If the murderer stole the Dead Bone Spice

16:36.510 --> 16:37.200
in order to break

16:37.200 --> 16:38.440
the illusion formation
in the Black Wind Forest,

16:38.440 --> 16:39.480
then why on earth

16:39.480 --> 16:41.810
did he want to enter
the Black Wind Forest?

16:43.720 --> 16:44.670
What a pity.

16:44.720 --> 16:46.510
Young Master Qingyang
demonstrated it himself,

16:46.510 --> 16:47.840
said it with certainty,

16:48.120 --> 16:49.320
and proved that puppetry

16:49.320 --> 16:51.960
couldn't help steal the Spice
from a locked room.

16:51.960 --> 16:52.750
So...

16:58.320 --> 16:59.840
Investigating to this point,

16:59.840 --> 17:01.440
the clue has gone cold again.

17:01.910 --> 17:02.870
My Lord, My Lady,

17:03.080 --> 17:04.609
have you ever thought about

17:05.069 --> 17:06.670
why those children's graves

17:06.960 --> 17:09.349
in the Black Wind Forest are empty?

17:11.780 --> 17:14.230
Let's assume those children are not dead.

17:14.349 --> 17:15.589
If they're not dead,

17:16.160 --> 17:18.560
why are there tombstones erected for them?

17:20.119 --> 17:22.380
Those children will die sooner or later.

17:22.510 --> 17:23.270
Two months ago,

17:23.270 --> 17:24.640
the murderer abducted the children

17:24.640 --> 17:26.839
not for ransom. The motive is a mystery.

17:28.480 --> 17:29.480
You should go back

17:29.660 --> 17:31.070
and start by investigating the children.

17:31.070 --> 17:31.880
Here.

17:31.150 --> 17:34.550
[Map of Dougu County]

17:32.030 --> 17:32.830
Here.

17:33.160 --> 17:33.960
And here.

17:34.270 --> 17:35.240
These alley entrances are

17:35.240 --> 17:36.510
on the only route from the county

17:36.510 --> 17:37.510
to the Black Wind Forest.

17:37.510 --> 17:38.680
You must strictly guard them

17:38.680 --> 17:39.510
day and night.

17:39.640 --> 17:40.920
Once suspicious people are spotted,

17:40.920 --> 17:41.880
arrest them immediately.

17:41.880 --> 17:42.680
Understood!

17:43.070 --> 17:43.880
Let's go.

17:47.480 --> 17:48.270
How is it?

17:50.160 --> 17:51.750
I've checked the household records
several times.

17:51.750 --> 17:53.480
Some children's families are farmers,

17:53.480 --> 17:54.510
some sell vegetables,

17:54.510 --> 17:55.830
and some do small businesses.

17:55.830 --> 17:57.350
There are boys and girls,
older and younger.

17:57.350 --> 17:58.830
Except for being children,

17:58.830 --> 18:00.430
they have nothing in common.

18:10.680 --> 18:11.880
Is everything ready?

18:12.240 --> 18:13.030
It's time to set off.

18:13.030 --> 18:14.090
Where are we going?

18:14.270 --> 18:15.070
Li Si,

18:15.160 --> 18:16.510
you trespassed into the government morgue,

18:16.510 --> 18:18.510
broke out of prison,
impersonated an official,

18:18.510 --> 18:19.880
and interfered with the investigation.

18:19.880 --> 18:21.680
You are now being arrested
and escorted back to Tianhuang City

18:21.680 --> 18:22.680
to stand trial.

18:27.830 --> 18:28.640
Go.

18:29.510 --> 18:30.350
Got it.

18:37.920 --> 18:38.750
Mr. Meng,

18:39.880 --> 18:40.550
will Lady Constable Frost

18:40.550 --> 18:41.920
run into danger

18:41.960 --> 18:43.270
staying here alone?

18:43.750 --> 18:45.070
What if that culprit

18:45.160 --> 18:46.820
has some tricks up his sleeve?

18:51.550 --> 18:52.590
Every extra day those children

18:52.590 --> 18:53.750
stay here just makes things

18:53.750 --> 18:55.150
more dangerous for them.

18:55.240 --> 18:56.350
Who on earth are you?

18:56.350 --> 18:58.480
Why do you care so much about this case?

18:58.640 --> 18:59.470
Or rather,

19:00.030 --> 19:01.350
do those missing children

19:01.350 --> 19:02.950
have anything to do with you?

19:03.270 --> 19:03.720
Go.

19:09.510 --> 19:10.160
My Lord!

19:10.920 --> 19:11.510
My Lord!

19:12.310 --> 19:13.310
My Lord, My Lord!

19:13.350 --> 19:15.350
Is there any news of my son, Yuanbao?

19:16.200 --> 19:16.790
No. Not yet.

19:16.790 --> 19:17.680
Stop running.

19:18.110 --> 19:19.070
Come over here.

19:19.070 --> 19:20.270
We'll butcher the pig later

19:20.270 --> 19:22.110
and offer its head to the Earth God,

19:22.110 --> 19:23.310
begging the Earth God

19:23.310 --> 19:26.370
to bless my son Yuanbao
to come home as soon as possible.

19:27.510 --> 19:28.960
Yuyao, be careful.

19:29.160 --> 19:30.350
Erbao, stop digging.

19:30.350 --> 19:31.350
There's no food there,

19:31.350 --> 19:32.720
only Yuanbao's tooth.

19:34.350 --> 19:35.110
Tooth?

19:39.750 --> 19:41.750
Come here, little piggy.

19:41.750 --> 19:43.100
Time to eat grass.

19:44.550 --> 19:45.350
Madam!

19:47.440 --> 19:49.300
What is it digging for over there?

19:49.830 --> 19:50.830
Yuanbao's tooth.

19:51.270 --> 19:51.920
According

19:51.920 --> 19:53.160
to our local custom,

19:53.160 --> 19:55.270
upper teeth go to the ground;
lower teeth go to the sky.

19:55.270 --> 19:56.240
I took our Yuanbao's

19:56.240 --> 19:57.110
fallen incisor

19:57.110 --> 19:58.240
and buried it there.

20:02.270 --> 20:03.110
Incisor?

20:11.960 --> 20:12.790
Mr. Meng.

20:14.750 --> 20:16.010
Aren't you looking for

20:16.110 --> 20:18.110
what those children have in common?

20:18.510 --> 20:20.070
I think I've figured it out.

20:46.980 --> 20:48.400
Mr. Wang, look.

20:48.400 --> 20:49.000
Yuanbao has

20:49.000 --> 20:50.110
reached the stage of losing teeth

20:50.110 --> 20:51.830
and often complains of toothaches.

20:51.830 --> 20:53.790
My teeth hurt so much.

20:54.550 --> 20:55.550
I see.

20:59.790 --> 21:00.590
Mother,

21:00.750 --> 21:02.080
it's my sister's tooth.

21:04.720 --> 21:05.650
My Lord! My Lady!

21:08.200 --> 21:08.960
In the other homes

21:08.960 --> 21:10.310
of the missing children,

21:10.310 --> 21:12.310
we also found their shed baby teeth.

21:13.680 --> 21:14.960
The murderer is indeed

21:15.160 --> 21:15.830
looking for kids

21:15.830 --> 21:17.630
who are losing their baby teeth.

21:18.350 --> 21:19.720
Now we have a direction.

21:19.720 --> 21:20.350
Ask them to make a list

21:20.350 --> 21:21.750
of children
who are losing their baby teeth

21:21.750 --> 21:24.010
and set up ambushes to catch the culprit.

21:30.440 --> 21:31.270
Li Qingyang!

21:31.680 --> 21:32.750
He got away again.

21:32.850 --> 21:33.520
Forget it.

21:33.550 --> 21:34.720
We'll catch him eventually.

21:34.720 --> 21:37.580
The priority is to find the kids
losing their teeth.

21:49.160 --> 21:51.550
[Dougu County Office]

21:57.510 --> 21:58.310
My Lord!

21:59.550 --> 22:00.310
My Lord!

22:01.650 --> 22:02.650
[Enter the County Office
to Examine Oneself]

22:02.710 --> 22:03.450
[Righteous Dougu County Magistrate]

22:02.880 --> 22:03.680
My Lord, this...

22:03.680 --> 22:04.440
My Lord.

22:05.920 --> 22:06.720
My Lord, My Lady,

22:06.720 --> 22:07.790
we've got the complete list.

22:07.790 --> 22:08.550
It's the full list

22:08.550 --> 22:09.510
of all the kids who are losing

22:09.510 --> 22:10.640
their baby teeth in Dougu County.

22:09.910 --> 22:11.500
[Chunfeng Hall, Sun Yuyao]

22:11.880 --> 22:12.680
Yuyao?

22:13.160 --> 22:14.560
Why is there only one kid?

22:14.720 --> 22:15.510
My Lady,

22:15.510 --> 22:16.400
Dougu County is

22:16.400 --> 22:17.510
a very small place.

22:17.510 --> 22:18.880
And with years of droughts,

22:18.880 --> 22:20.350
crop failures, and a population decline,

22:20.350 --> 22:22.510
there can't be many children left!

22:23.720 --> 22:25.070
The night the children went missing,

22:25.070 --> 22:26.680
why did the murderer take all the children

22:26.680 --> 22:28.030
except for Yuyao?

22:28.200 --> 22:29.000
That night, Yuyao was with me

22:29.000 --> 22:29.880
at the county office.

22:29.880 --> 22:31.810
The murderer didn't have a chance.

22:32.000 --> 22:34.060
But now Mrs. Hua is taking care of her.

22:34.160 --> 22:34.960
Let's go.

22:36.720 --> 22:38.110
My Lord! My Lady! Bad news!

22:37.720 --> 22:40.290
[Righteous Dougu County Magistrate]

22:38.110 --> 22:38.440
My Lady!

22:38.440 --> 22:38.720
What's up?

22:38.720 --> 22:39.270
Bad news!

22:39.270 --> 22:40.480
Yuyao is missing!

22:40.480 --> 22:41.410
My Lord, My Lady.

22:41.510 --> 22:43.110
Weren't there staff
from the county office watching her?

22:43.110 --> 22:44.750
I just went to put
the freshly butchered pig's head

22:44.750 --> 22:46.110
in the Earth God Temple.

22:46.110 --> 22:47.110
When I turned around,

22:47.110 --> 22:48.510
Yuyao was just gone.

22:48.550 --> 22:49.640
My Lord, My Lady, what should we do?

22:49.640 --> 22:50.970
Let's find Yuyao first.

22:51.350 --> 22:52.230
[Enter the County Office
to Examine Oneself]

22:53.110 --> 22:55.350
Tanghulu (candied haws)!

22:56.400 --> 22:57.310
Eat slowly.

22:58.210 --> 23:02.890
[Rice Shop]

22:59.310 --> 23:00.770
Tanghulu (candied haws)!

23:01.550 --> 23:03.350
-I want one, too!
-Kiddo, want some tanghulu?

23:03.350 --> 23:03.920
Here you are.

23:03.920 --> 23:05.310
Come and see!

23:05.310 --> 23:06.310
Let's go, Yuyao.

23:06.310 --> 23:06.920
Take care!

23:07.510 --> 23:08.910
Let's go look over there.

23:10.070 --> 23:10.720
Little girl.

23:10.720 --> 23:13.750
-A little hat!
-You've got good taste. This one's pretty.

23:13.750 --> 23:14.590
Sir, take a look.

23:14.590 --> 23:15.050
Come on.

23:16.070 --> 23:17.800
The tiger one looks energetic.

23:18.070 --> 23:18.880
Yuyao.

23:20.030 --> 23:20.830
Madam.

23:20.920 --> 23:22.450
I want to see the one behind.

23:23.790 --> 23:24.640
So pretty.

23:25.880 --> 23:26.680
Yuyao,

23:27.480 --> 23:28.750
have you had fun today?

23:29.270 --> 23:30.110
Yes.

23:31.960 --> 23:35.240
If only Yuanbao, Erniu, and Cuicui were

23:35.310 --> 23:37.270
here, too.

23:37.750 --> 23:38.960
Mr. Young Master,

23:38.960 --> 23:39.750
were they really

23:39.750 --> 23:41.510
taken away by bad guys?

23:41.960 --> 23:42.750
Yuyao,

23:43.000 --> 23:44.110
I promise you

23:44.310 --> 23:45.750
I will definitely save your friends

23:45.750 --> 23:47.310
from the bad guys.

23:47.310 --> 23:48.070
Okay?

23:49.000 --> 23:51.110
Don't forget to beat up the bad guys, too.

23:51.110 --> 23:53.110
Of course I will beat up the bad guys.

23:54.310 --> 23:55.480
I hate those

23:56.000 --> 23:57.750
who bully children the most.

23:58.750 --> 23:59.550
Let's go.

24:02.310 --> 24:03.110
Boss.

24:05.240 --> 24:06.030
Let's go.

24:07.750 --> 24:08.640
You haven't paid!

24:08.640 --> 24:09.310
That bottle

24:09.310 --> 24:10.310
is worth

24:10.310 --> 24:11.370
your entire stall.

24:15.790 --> 24:16.960
It smells so good!

24:19.400 --> 24:20.400
It's Dead Bone Spice.

24:20.400 --> 24:21.790
Where did you get this bottle?

24:21.790 --> 24:22.750
A gentleman used it

24:22.750 --> 24:24.070
to pay just now.

24:24.350 --> 24:25.550
The symbol of the Star-Gathering Pavilion.

24:25.380 --> 24:27.220
[Gathering]

24:26.310 --> 24:27.310
Li Qingyang.

24:28.000 --> 24:29.110
Did you see that gentleman

24:29.110 --> 24:30.110
have a child by his side?

24:30.110 --> 24:30.830
Yes!

24:30.960 --> 24:32.510
He was with a little girl.

24:32.510 --> 24:33.960
He took Yuyao away.

24:34.750 --> 24:36.070
If he were the murderer,

24:36.070 --> 24:38.110
he wouldn't have helped us
investigate the cases all along.

24:38.110 --> 24:39.510
What I'm worried about now is

24:39.510 --> 24:41.000
that even if he's on our side

24:41.000 --> 24:42.400
and wants to help us catch the murderer,

24:42.400 --> 24:44.130
Yuyao could still be in danger.

24:44.590 --> 24:45.790
Meng, think about it.

24:45.790 --> 24:47.250
Why did he take Yuyao away?

24:47.310 --> 24:48.350
Simply because he knew Yuyao was

24:48.350 --> 24:49.750
the last child.

24:50.110 --> 24:51.400
If he uses Yuyao as bait,

24:51.400 --> 24:53.530
the murderer will definitely show up.

24:54.160 --> 24:55.240
This bastard!

24:55.680 --> 24:56.750
How dare he treat a child's life

24:56.750 --> 24:57.510
like it's nothing!

24:57.440 --> 25:01.500
[Chunfeng Hall]

25:09.260 --> 25:15.780
[Chunfeng Hall]

25:10.200 --> 25:12.920
Emperor of Heaven,

25:14.110 --> 25:17.590
Emperor of Earth,

25:18.160 --> 25:24.880
there's a boy in my home crying at night.

25:26.830 --> 25:30.680
-Gentlemen passing by,
-Here he comes, as expected.

25:30.680 --> 25:33.750
read it three times,

25:34.880 --> 25:42.960
and he will sleep soundly until daybreak.

25:56.830 --> 25:57.640
Yuyao,

25:57.790 --> 25:58.640
Yuyao!

25:58.960 --> 26:01.720
Come out and play.

25:59.210 --> 26:01.920
[Chunfeng Hall]

26:08.480 --> 26:09.310
Come on.

26:10.070 --> 26:11.110
Come out.

26:12.550 --> 26:13.960
Let's play together.

26:14.960 --> 26:16.830
Let's have fun together.

26:39.270 --> 26:40.240
My Lord, My Lady.

26:42.880 --> 26:44.350
You came neither early nor late,

26:44.350 --> 26:45.270
just in time.

26:46.880 --> 26:47.720
Mr. Meng,

26:48.790 --> 26:49.750
it's too late.

26:50.310 --> 26:51.920
Yuyao's mind has already been seized

26:51.920 --> 26:52.980
by the puppet doll.

26:53.920 --> 26:55.240
If we act rashly,

26:55.400 --> 26:57.200
Yuyao might be in graver danger.

26:58.550 --> 26:59.720
Good point, Ms. Bai.

27:00.310 --> 27:01.160
Now,

27:01.720 --> 27:03.550
we just need to wait for the puppet doll

27:03.550 --> 27:05.340
to take Yuyao to its destination.

27:05.340 --> 27:08.070
The murderer will
let his or her guard down by then.

27:08.070 --> 27:08.880
That way,

27:09.200 --> 27:10.730
we'll have a better chance.

27:11.110 --> 27:11.750
I didn't expect

27:11.750 --> 27:13.510
you to actually use Yuyao as bait!

27:13.510 --> 27:14.920
Who was it that kept saying

27:14.920 --> 27:16.920
hurting children is unforgivable?

27:16.960 --> 27:17.830
Mr. Meng,

27:18.110 --> 27:19.710
if you are done lecturing me,

27:19.720 --> 27:21.550
why don't we go after them together?

27:21.550 --> 27:22.510
How's that?

27:24.200 --> 27:25.380
[Chunfeng Hall]

27:33.140 --> 27:37.010
[Chunfeng Hall]

27:33.350 --> 27:35.410
Golden needles blocked my channels,

27:35.680 --> 27:37.880
and a heavy strike sealed my acupoints.

27:39.310 --> 27:40.480
Great,

27:41.000 --> 27:42.930
even an immortal can't escape now.

27:43.030 --> 27:43.830
Li Si,

27:44.480 --> 27:46.110
I hate people who disregard

27:46.110 --> 27:48.170
children's lives the most in my life.

27:48.310 --> 27:49.400
Once the murderer is brought to justice,

27:49.400 --> 27:50.160
I swear I'll throw you

27:50.160 --> 27:52.620
into the Divine Constable Bureau's prison!

27:55.000 --> 27:55.750
Let's go.

28:45.310 --> 28:46.240
Dead Bone Spice?

28:48.480 --> 28:49.270
As expected,

28:49.920 --> 28:51.950
the missing children from the county are

28:51.950 --> 28:53.750
right in this Black Wind Forest.

29:15.310 --> 29:16.510
So this Dead Bone Spice

29:16.510 --> 29:17.240
can not only break

29:17.240 --> 29:18.720
the illusion formation
in the Black Wind Forest

29:18.720 --> 29:21.000
but also open a path
through these flowers.

29:21.000 --> 29:21.960
This proves

29:22.510 --> 29:23.970
we've found the right way.

30:00.160 --> 30:01.400
There seems to be some writing

30:01.400 --> 30:02.730
behind this spider web.

30:22.510 --> 30:23.440
This is

30:24.110 --> 30:25.310
the writing of Liluo?

30:25.920 --> 30:26.720
I recognize it,

30:26.720 --> 30:28.070
but I don't know what it means.

30:28.070 --> 30:29.200
The Kingdom of Liluo that was

30:29.200 --> 30:30.510
destroyed
by the late Emperor Wuzong of Shi

30:30.510 --> 30:31.510
47 years ago?

30:41.020 --> 30:41.820
Could it be

30:42.120 --> 30:43.360
that the puppet dolls

30:43.380 --> 30:45.250
and the incident from 17 years ago

30:45.280 --> 30:47.880
have something to do
with the Kingdom of Liluo?

31:25.650 --> 31:26.480
Zhenzhu?

31:35.000 --> 31:35.790
Meng Rui!

31:50.640 --> 31:51.440
Li Si!

31:52.400 --> 31:53.200
What...

31:53.310 --> 31:54.110
Let me check.

31:55.640 --> 31:56.440
It's nothing.

31:57.720 --> 31:58.510
I'm fine.

32:01.960 --> 32:03.490
It's just that I was stabbed

32:03.510 --> 32:05.440
by Lord Constable Ghost last time.

32:06.550 --> 32:08.440
Now the wound has reopened.

32:08.720 --> 32:09.650
It won't kill me.

32:12.030 --> 32:12.830
Sorry.

32:14.640 --> 32:15.440
Li Si,

32:15.960 --> 32:17.290
thank you for saving us.

32:19.750 --> 32:21.610
My Lord, My Lady, what's this for?

32:22.310 --> 32:23.160
I'm fine.

32:24.880 --> 32:25.830
The priority is to save them.

32:25.830 --> 32:26.590
Let's go.

32:43.750 --> 32:45.480
It was originally a sure thing.

32:45.550 --> 32:46.960
I didn't expect that Li Si

32:47.000 --> 32:48.440
would risk his own life

32:48.440 --> 32:50.000
to break through the sealed acupoints

32:50.000 --> 32:52.160
and save those two
from the Divine Constable Bureau.

32:52.160 --> 32:54.510
You've really disappointed me.

32:55.890 --> 32:57.070
Please rest assured!

32:57.070 --> 32:58.640
I will protect God Kelu

32:58.720 --> 33:00.270
and the Sacred Moluo Fruit

33:00.270 --> 33:01.730
even at the cost of my life!

33:29.160 --> 33:30.070
So big.

33:35.350 --> 33:37.160
This flower must be

33:37.750 --> 33:38.640
the mother plant

33:38.640 --> 33:40.570
of those bizarre flowers outside.

34:02.000 --> 34:03.730
Inside these are all children!

34:09.880 --> 34:10.679
It's Yuanbao.

34:12.360 --> 34:13.150
Yuanbao.

34:13.760 --> 34:14.550
Yuanbao.

34:15.510 --> 34:16.360
Yuanbao!

35:04.550 --> 35:06.150
The person who set up Spider's Tear

35:06.150 --> 35:07.630
must be nearby.

35:08.880 --> 35:09.760
Be careful.

35:21.710 --> 35:22.570
Show yourself!

36:27.110 --> 36:27.920
May I

36:28.960 --> 36:30.160
have your name, lady?

36:40.320 --> 36:43.320
How dare you profane
the Sacred Moluo Fruit?

36:46.710 --> 36:47.770
It's livor mortis.

36:48.400 --> 36:49.200
Wait a minute.

36:49.510 --> 36:50.670
Don't you think

36:51.110 --> 36:53.110
the dress of the woman in front of us

36:53.480 --> 36:54.680
looks very familiar?

36:56.920 --> 36:58.070
Tumi House was burglarized

36:58.070 --> 36:59.360
2 months ago.

36:59.590 --> 37:00.480
But

37:00.670 --> 37:01.550
somehow,

37:01.550 --> 37:02.510
the owner of this shop

37:02.510 --> 37:03.150
seemed to have

37:03.150 --> 37:04.480
suffered a great hit

37:04.670 --> 37:05.550
and gone mad.

37:05.710 --> 37:07.070
Lady Fragrance?

37:07.480 --> 37:08.810
The person in front of us

37:08.880 --> 37:10.630
must be the long-missing

37:10.670 --> 37:12.360
real owner of Tumi House,

37:12.550 --> 37:13.920
Lady Fragrance.

37:15.360 --> 37:16.670
You guessed it right.

37:17.110 --> 37:18.920
Her elder brother used her blood

37:18.920 --> 37:20.450
to refine Dead Bone Spice.

37:20.710 --> 37:22.190
And I used her body

37:22.190 --> 37:23.880
to make a human puppet.

37:24.360 --> 37:26.440
Compared to puppet dolls,

37:26.550 --> 37:28.960
this lifelike human puppet is

37:28.960 --> 37:30.620
far superior.

37:31.280 --> 37:32.070
Come out!

37:32.110 --> 37:33.710
Or I'll cut down this flower!

37:35.550 --> 37:38.150
The only chance of survival
for these children

37:38.280 --> 37:39.710
relies entirely

37:39.710 --> 37:41.510
on the great Tianmoluo.

37:42.070 --> 37:43.710
If the flower dies,

37:43.710 --> 37:45.240
they won't survive either!

37:45.880 --> 37:47.840
This Spirit of Tianmoluo is

37:48.190 --> 37:51.110
a remnant from the ancient Liluo Sect.

37:51.710 --> 37:54.070
These Moluo Flowers in the canyon are

37:54.070 --> 37:56.280
all its descendants.

37:56.920 --> 38:00.670
It is the soul of God Kelu!

38:06.960 --> 38:08.190
Liluo fell

38:08.190 --> 38:09.110
47 years ago.

38:09.760 --> 38:12.090
You were the one who transplanted it here?

38:12.510 --> 38:14.230
Forty-seven years ago,

38:14.880 --> 38:17.230
the Shi Empire wiped out Liluo,

38:17.510 --> 38:19.240
